From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:22:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] docs: the definitions no edge reads, and the change's
 totals

The allocation guide's "Recipes evicted before a read" and
"Rematerialization" describe the dead definitions whose fragment reaches
their block's end; the IR guide's remaining costs of the hoist no longer
include hexFunc's. By callgrind at main 389d25b9: speedtest1 -0.69%,
Lua's scripts -2.96%.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NNmNQsNkec1N4WJ65hh6VB
Signed-off-by: David Gonzalez Martin <davidgmbb@gmail.com>
---
 docs/ir.md               | 13 +++++++------
 docs/tier1-allocation.md | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

